{
  "id": "exchange-student-welcome",
  "title": "接待交換學生",
  "titleEn": "Welcoming an Exchange Student",
  "category": "社交人際",
  "level": "進階",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/exchange-student-welcome.webp",
    "alt": "在熱鬧的高中校門前，一位親切的台灣高中生微笑著迎接初來乍到的外國交換學生，並熱心引導對方認識校園環境與教學設施。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "At the front gate, Emily greets Mark, a "
        },
        {
          "text": "foreign",
          "wordIds": [
            "foreign"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "exchange",
          "wordIds": [
            "exchange"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " student from Seattle."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在學校大門前，Emily 親切迎接來自西雅圖的外國交換學生 Mark。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f0d86778443684c2401623f354e7d5af0788e7c64ee1470a5ab60ad5b59f8867",
        "sha256": "f696912d807aa6fbe468543876c9383fb40166057c6c364ecbd4e4d80c8d1187"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "With a bright smile, she waves her hand and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Welcome",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-school"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "welcome"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to our school!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "welcome-to-our-school"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她帶著燦爛的微笑揮手致意，並說道：「歡迎來到我們學校！」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "9b196255ea018ba91d955ef60133ded99c8d637bd7ddb2dec057264434fc29af",
        "sha256": "40d00fb49fa2e1742cca5cd78419bd204bc122845387de7f7a96ae24a1a933d5"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Emily enthusiastically offers, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let me show you around.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "let-me-show-you-around"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 熱情地提議：「讓我帶你參觀一下周遭環境。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "43526f56f9df85493a3bb12da6fbf40cc55fbe99d5eead0ce6276ffecca5658e",
        "sha256": "84cdb5fbbb4c1613da8e374d1550306ebe75cbd144bf8dc506a6a83d7fa6bf7b"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She will "
        },
        {
          "text": "guide",
          "wordIds": [
            "guide"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " him to explore each modern "
        },
        {
          "text": "campus",
          "wordIds": [
            "campus"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "facility",
          "wordIds": [
            "facility"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", starting with the main academic building."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "她將引導他探索每一處現代化的校園設施，首先從主教學大樓開始。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "15ffa5adf88545d36adf97f6a2014459cef6a26cb8ee152d4316f0380cc8a77f",
        "sha256": "dbe0877d9d6777b32c0268512805cc8f40494352ab9effb8a8bd3b1144f39408"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Pointing toward a spacious hall, she says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Here is the library.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "here-is-the-library"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "指著一座寬敞的大樓，她說道：「這裡是圖書館。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "16e389e2a676bfe5752f45972325559a7221473160c78a706412e1b23f0706dd",
        "sha256": "f027413d5e090e29a45db19e0a5a90f1061941c097ab5f5f3cfbcf9a32f05033"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Next, she highlights the cafeteria nearby, where students gather for lunch and relax between classes."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著，她介紹了附近的學生餐廳，學生們午餐時間會在那裡聚餐並在課間放鬆。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "0285123a6cf49fbf37094bc681c21f9aecd1c68ee86c17709275cc4a62e0ff2e",
        "sha256": "3e825fb863cb5f9cf504ab6d188a7fbf7da60669492f211d5139cab69c7edeaf"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Offering her full support, Emily smiles and adds, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Feel free to ask me anything.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "feel-free-to-ask-me-anything"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Emily 熱心提供全力協助，微笑著補充道：「隨時都可以問我任何問題。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/exchange-student-welcome/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "64a9d24e333c73a2dd903cd171a273b3dc2164308cfd40a5957bb70bd7f95beb",
        "sha256": "873cc54a8a06aab79e6dd36f97ce52383a82339ba8f82b2fa8464356d41a9d76"
      }
    }
  ],
